pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "#FFFFFF"
elements:
  # ---------- header ----------
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 28, 700, 16]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$faint"
      letterSpacing: 2
      wrap: false
      text: KIMI K3 · SPECULATIVE DECODING · RECOVERSSM
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 48, 864, 32]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: 思源宋体
      wrap: false
      align: [left, middle]
      text: Verify → Commit 时序：候选链全量展开，仅接受前缀被重建写回
  - elementId: head-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 94, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$rule"}

  # ---------- phase 1: verify ----------
  - elementId: verify-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 114, 800, 18]
    content:
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">①</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">　</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$ink"><strong>Verify —— 从已提交 checkpoint 前向展开整条候选链，输出 \(y_t\)并保存 \(R_t\)，checkpoint 不变</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: verify-bracket
    elementType: line
    bounds: [88, 142, 582, 8]
    viewBox: [582, 8]
    points: "0,8 0,0 582,0 582,8"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$faint"}

  # acceptance labels
  - elementId: accept-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [286, 158, 184, 14]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$accent"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 接受前缀 1…n（参与重建）
  - elementId: reject-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [490, 158, 200, 14]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$faint"
      wrap: false
      text: 被拒绝 suffix（不读取）

  # ---------- state chain ----------
  - elementId: node-s0
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [64, 186, 48, 48]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: node-s0-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [64, 186, 48, 48]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(S_0\)</p>
  - elementId: node-s0-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [38, 238, 100, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$gray"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: checkpoint（已提交）

  - elementId: arrow-1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [114, 206, 54, 4]
    viewBox: [54, 4]
    points: "0,2 54,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: arrow-1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [104, 168, 140, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$gray"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>每步输入\((k_t,\,g_t,\,u_t)\)</p>

  - elementId: node-s1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [170, 186, 44, 44]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: node-s1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 186, 44, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(S_1\)</p>
  - elementId: node-s1-rec
    elementType: text
    bounds: [170, 238, 44, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$gray"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(R_1\)</p>

  - elementId: arrow-2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [216, 206, 58, 4]
    viewBox: [58, 4]
    points: "0,2 58,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}

  - elementId: node-s2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [276, 186, 44, 44]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: node-s2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [276, 186, 44, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$ink"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(S_2\)</p>
  - elementId: node-s2-rec
    elementType: text
    bounds: [276, 238, 44, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$gray"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(R_2\)</p>

  - elementId: arrow-3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [322, 206, 20, 4]
    viewBox: [20, 4]
    points: "0,2 20,2"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}
  - elementId: dots-1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [344, 194, 36, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$gray"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: …
  - elementId: arrow-4
    elementType: line
    bounds: [382, 206, 20, 4]
    viewBox: [20, 4]
    points: "0,2 20,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}

  - elementId: node-sn
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [404, 186, 44, 44]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: node-sn-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [404, 186, 44, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$accent"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(S_n\)</p>
  - elementId: node-sn-rec
    elementType: text
    bounds: [404, 238, 44, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$accent"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(R_n\)</p>

  - elementId: arrow-5
    elementType: line
    bounds: [450, 206, 24, 4]
    viewBox: [24, 4]
    points: "0,2 24,2"
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$ink"}

  # acceptance boundary
  - elementId: boundary
    elementType: line
    bounds: [476, 156, 4, 144]
    viewBox: [4, 144]
    points: "2,0 2,144"
    border: {style: dash, width: 1.5, color: "$faint"}

  - elementId: arrow-6
    elementType: line
    bounds: [486, 206, 28, 4]
    viewBox: [28, 4]
    points: "0,2 28,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: dash, width: 1.5, color: "$faint"}

  - elementId: node-sn1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [516, 186, 44, 44]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: dash, width: 1.5, color: "$faint"}
  - elementId: node-sn1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 186, 44, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$faint"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(S_{n+1}\)</p>

  - elementId: arrow-7
    elementType: line
    bounds: [562, 206, 18, 4]
    viewBox: [18, 4]
    points: "0,2 18,2"
    border: {style: dash, width: 1.5, color: "$faint"}
  - elementId: dots-2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [582, 194, 36, 24]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$faint"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: …
  - elementId: arrow-8
    elementType: line
    bounds: [620, 206, 24, 4]
    viewBox: [24, 4]
    points: "0,2 24,2"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: dash, width: 1.5, color: "$faint"}

  - elementId: node-sl
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [648, 186, 44, 44]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    border: {style: dash, width: 1.5, color: "$faint"}
  - elementId: node-sl-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 186, 44, 44]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$faint"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(S_L\)</p>

  # records legend + rejected note
  - elementId: rec-legend
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 258, 320, 14]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$faint"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>每位置记录\(R_t=(u_t,\,k_t,\,g^{\mathrm{raw}}_t)\)，开销\(O(V+2K)\)</p>
  - elementId: reject-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [516, 238, 176, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$faint"
      align: [center, top]
      wrap: false
      text: suffix 记录本轮结束后释放

  # ---------- commit arrow down ----------
  - elementId: commit-arrow
    elementType: line
    bounds: [476, 300, 4, 36]
    viewBox: [4, 36]
    points: "2,0 2,36"
    arrow: [null, arrow]
    border: {style: solid, width: 1.5, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: commit-arrow-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [490, 308, 180, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$accent"
      wrap: false
      text: commit 只读前 n 条记录

  # ---------- bottom steps ----------
  - elementId: step2-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 336, 250, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$rule"}
  - elementId: step2-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 348, 250, 20]
    content:
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">②</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">　</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$ink"><strong>Rejection sampling</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: step2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 372, 250, 96]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$gray"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>MRV1 采样器返回 num_accepted_tokens \(n\in[0,L]\)（含 leading target token）；packed KDA 行经 speculative request mask 映射到 sampler 行，填充 ID \(-1\)被排除。</p>

  - elementId: step3-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [330, 336, 320, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$rule"}
  - elementId: step3-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [330, 348, 320, 20]
    content:
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">③</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">　</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$ink"><strong>Commit —— 反向累积，写回原 slot</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: step3-formula
    elementType: text
    bounds: [330, 372, 320, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$ink"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>\(S_{\mathrm{rebuilt}} = S_0\,P + U\)</p>
  - elementId: step3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [330, 400, 320, 72]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$gray"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>从 \(t=n\)反向遍历到 \(1\)：\(U\gets U+u_t\hat{k}_t^{\mathsf{T}}P\)，\(P\gets D_tP\)，与闭式表达等价；结果写回该 request 的原生 checkpoint slot，随后释放本轮 pending records。</p>

  - elementId: step4-rule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [682, 336, 230, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$rule"}
  - elementId: step4-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [682, 348, 230, 20]
    content:
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">④</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$accent">　</span><span style="font-size:13px;color:$ink"><strong>下一轮</strong></span></p>
  - elementId: step4-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [682, 372, 230, 96]
    content:
      fontSize: 10
      color: "$gray"
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>state copy 从已写回的 slot 开始，KDA 递推链在数学上保持连续；卷积历史沿原有 accepted-length 逻辑处理。</p>

  # ---------- footer ----------
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 524, 864, 13]
    content:
      fontSize: 9
      color: "$faint"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>依据 <a href="https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/pull/19087">vllm-ascend PR #19087</a>（kda_recoverssm_verify / kda_recoverssm_commit）实现整理</p>
